i>Designed around standard 1&quot; EMT</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"esg-mini-col\">\n          <h4>Typical competitor setup</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Multiple screen tiers</li>\n            <li>Premium materials may cost extra</li>\n            <li>More decision fatigue before checkout</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-mini-badge\">\n        Better foundation, better value, better out-of-the-box setup\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-mini-note\">\n        See full comparison and customization details lower on the page.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n{% endif %}"
